The data this plugin reads are Japan's Ministry of Finance's, published on
its website: the Japanese Government Bonds' interest rates on a constant
maturity basis. Source: Ministry of Finance, Japan
(https://www.mof.go.jp/english/policy/jgbs/reference/interest_rate/index.htm).
The Ministry's site content is under the Public Data License (Version 1.0)
unless otherwise provided. The rates are calculated from the Japan
Securities Dealers Association's Reference Statistical Prices for OTC Bond
Transactions. The committed answers are unedited.
This project is not affiliated with or endorsed by the Ministry of Finance.
